{"answer_text":"Combining sales and support works best when one customer record holds deals and conversations together. Tools that make that practical:\n\n### Top picks\n\n1. **Brightdesk Helpdesk** — strong reporting and automations, though the interface feels dated.\n2. **Calmline** — the most pleasant shared inbox for small support teams; reporting is basic.\n3. **Kestrel CRM** — sales-only for now.\n\n**Bottom line:** Brightdesk is the strongest fit for most teams; Calmline is a lighter alternative.","answer_uid":"01a1f315-50f5-7654-a9a5-c5a99c8dfc4f","brand_id":"01a1f315-4dca-7769-a972-a260bfb8c145","collection_mode":"api","cost_usd":0.0109,"created_at":"2026-11-18T08:02:00.750Z","engine":"chatgpt","extraction_status":"ok","extras":null,"fanouts":["sales and support in one tool"],"latency_ms":7030,"location_applied":true,"market_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-88a12333f09a","market_name":"United Kingdom","mentions":[{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-889d8a28ba29","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":1,"method":"alias","name":"Brightdesk","name_text":"Brightdesk","offsets":[[157,167],[402,412]],"pos":1,"recommended":true,"relation":"direct","sentiment":"mixed","sentiment_reason":"Strengths are noted alongside a clear drawback."},{"entity_id":"01a1f315-562a-7171-9ab9-2edaafa5b276","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":2,"method":"llm","name":"Calmline","name_text":"Calmline","offsets":[[254,262]],"pos":2,"recommended":false,"relation":"indirect","sentiment":"mixed","sentiment_reason":"Strengths are noted alongside a clear drawback."},{"entity_id":"01a1f315-5864-7406-ad9e-7a386e391e3e","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":3,"method":"llm","name":"Kestrel CRM","name_text":"Kestrel CRM","offsets":[[348,359]],"pos":3,"recommended":false,"relation":"direct","sentiment":"neutral","sentiment_reason":"Listed factually without praise or criticism."}],"model":"gpt-6-luna","prompt_id":"01a1f315-4dcf-76a1-bfe0-6a98cf16463b","prompt_text":"How to